Z||000004||loafer87gt||12-14-2001||09:02 PM||||I loved the MI games. THem, and the old Sierra Hero's Quest games rocked. You can download all the old Lucasarts and Sierra adventures games for free now off the net. Just do a search for Abandonwares. These are all the old games that you can no longer buy in stores or order. You can find almost all the old Sierra and Lucasarts game for download now on AW sites. Here is the link for Secret of Monkey Island.<BR> <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/adventuresworld/gamelist.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/adventuresworld/gamelist.html</A> <P>Here are a couple good sites for grabbing golden oldies.<BR> <A HREF="http://www.iarc.org/~4x4pf/main.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.iarc.org/~4x4pf/main.htm</A> <BR> <A HREF="http://www.theunderdogs.org/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.theunderdogs.org/</A> ||||reg||5
